{
  "name": "IAM Privilege Escalation via PassRole",
  "description": "Low-privilege user 'ci-builder' has iam:PassRole on a powerful 'lambda-deploy-admin' role plus lambda:CreateFunction. They (or someone with their long-lived access key) chain those to deploy a Lambda that assumes the powerful role and runs whatever they want.",
  "reasoning": "AWS control plane only — IAM, Lambda, CloudTrail. The simulation models the discovery + exploitation pattern, then containment by removing the dangerous policy combo.",
